{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "35734418",
      "title": "Deployment Example",
      "sourceHash": "02e425ac05e6f379c35206ea8a029fb75b72a31656d507771367631ac070ffdd",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.16,
          "end": 4.77,
          "en": "So now that we built the app for production,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.77,
          "end": 6.81,
          "en": "let's upload it to a server.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.81,
          "end": 8.37,
          "en": "Let's deploy it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.37,
          "end": 11.01,
          "en": "And when it comes to deploying our website,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.01,
          "end": 12.39,
          "en": "it is really important",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 12.39,
          "end": 16.74,
          "en": "that a React single page application is a static website.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.74,
          "end": 21.45,
          "en": "It consists of only HTML, CSS, and JavaScript files",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.45,
          "end": 23.91,
          "en": "and maybe a couple of images,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.91,
          "end": 27.99,
          "en": "but it contains no code that must be executed on the server.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 27.99,
          "end": 31.41,
          "en": "Instead, all the code will be parsed by the browser",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 31.41,
          "end": 35.073,
          "en": "and will be executed on the computers of our visitors.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 36.3,
          "end": 39.6,
          "en": "Therefore, we only need a Static Site Host.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 39.6,
          "end": 43.32,
          "en": "We don't need any hosting provider that executes code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 43.32,
          "end": 44.49,
          "en": "on the server.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 44.49,
          "end": 46.02,
          "en": "Such providers exist,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 46.02,
          "end": 48.27,
          "en": "and for certain projects you need them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 48.27,
          "end": 49.103,
          "en": "For example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 49.103,
          "end": 52.2,
          "en": "if you're building full stack React applications",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 52.2,
          "end": 54.75,
          "en": "as you could be doing with my learn course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 54.75,
          "end": 57.45,
          "en": "or the next course or some other courses.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 57.45,
          "end": 60.42,
          "en": "But if you're just building a React single page application,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 60.42,
          "end": 62.97,
          "en": "you don't execute any server site code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 62.97,
          "end": 66.03,
          "en": "You just need a Static Site Host.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 66.03,
          "end": 68.37,
          "en": "Now, if you search for deploy static site,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 68.37,
          "end": 69.99,
          "en": "you'll find many articles",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 69.99,
          "end": 74.07,
          "en": "that walk you through possible deployment providers",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 74.07,
          "end": 75.36,
          "en": "and processes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 75.36,
          "end": 78.48,
          "en": "You'll find many deployment and hosting providers.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 78.48,
          "end": 80.88,
          "en": "You'll find blog posts and much more.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 80.88,
          "end": 84.36,
          "en": "And for this course here, for this section,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 84.36,
          "end": 86.78999999999999,
          "en": "I will actually use Firebase Hosting,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 86.78999999999999,
          "end": 90,
          "en": "which is one of the many available providers,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 90,
          "end": 90.96000000000001,
          "en": "but it is a provider",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 90.96000000000001,
          "end": 93.78,
          "en": "that makes hosting static sites pretty easy",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 93.78,
          "end": 96.75999999999999,
          "en": "and therefore it is the provider I will use here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 96.75999999999999,
          "end": 98.82,
          "en": "Now, if you wanna use Firebase Hosting,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 98.82,
          "end": 100.86,
          "en": "you can visit their official documentation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 100.86,
          "end": 102.21000000000001,
          "en": "to learn all about it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 102.21000000000001,
          "end": 103.44,
          "en": "But of course, we're going to walk",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 103.44,
          "end": 106.5,
          "en": "through the steps together over the next minutes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 106.5,
          "end": 108.9,
          "en": "But you will also need a Google account.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 108.9,
          "end": 111.96000000000001,
          "en": "So here I'll quickly log in with my account",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 111.96000000000001,
          "end": 114.63300000000001,
          "en": "and once logged in, we can create a new project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 115.59,
          "end": 119.13,
          "en": "Now I'll name this project React deployment demo.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 119.13,
          "end": 121.083,
          "en": "The name of course is up to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 122.94,
          "end": 124.5,
          "en": "And then we can continue here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 124.5,
          "end": 126.9,
          "en": "We don't need to enable Google Analytics.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 126.9,
          "end": 129.39,
          "en": "Instead we can create a project like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 129.39,
          "end": 130.95,
          "en": "And Firebase is a service",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 130.95,
          "end": 133.41,
          "en": "that offers many other services as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 133.41,
          "end": 135.57,
          "en": "It, for example, also offers services",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 135.57,
          "end": 138.39,
          "en": "that would allow us to execute code on the server.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 138.39,
          "end": 140.01,
          "en": "But here we're only interested",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 140.01,
          "end": 142.82999999999998,
          "en": "in its static site hosting service.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 142.82999999999998,
          "end": 147.57,
          "en": "So let's wait for it to finish set up, which it did now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 147.57,
          "end": 152.28300000000002,
          "en": "And now we can get started by clicking on build, hosting.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 155.57999999999998,
          "end": 157.92000000000002,
          "en": "Now here we can get started with hosting a site",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 157.92000000000002,
          "end": 161.19,
          "en": "and we get this convenient walkthrough process",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 161.19,
          "end": 164.22,
          "en": "which tells us exactly what we have to do.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 164.22,
          "end": 167.34,
          "en": "And the first step is that we install a tool that helps us",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 167.34,
          "end": 171.39,
          "en": "with uploading our code to the Firebase servers.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 171.39,
          "end": 173.34,
          "en": "So I'll copy that command",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 173.34,
          "end": 176.073,
          "en": "and execute that command here in my terminal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 176.97,
          "end": 180.09,
          "en": "Now on MacrosAnalytics you might need to add sudo",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 180.09,
          "end": 183.783,
          "en": "in front of that for that command to execute successfully.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 184.8,
          "end": 188.76,
          "en": "Now this will install these fire based tools on your system",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 188.76,
          "end": 190.5,
          "en": "and once they have been installed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 190.5,
          "end": 193.11,
          "en": "we can continue with the next step,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 193.11,
          "end": 194.76,
          "en": "which is that we must log in",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 194.76,
          "end": 197.07,
          "en": "with that tool that we just installed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 197.07,
          "end": 198.66,
          "en": "log into our Google account",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 198.66,
          "end": 201.57,
          "en": "because of course we need some way of authenticating",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 201.57,
          "end": 205.65,
          "en": "our requests that are sent through that tool to Firebase",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 205.65,
          "end": 208.983,
          "en": "to upload that code to our account and project here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 210.18,
          "end": 212.49,
          "en": "So therefore, I'll wait for this setup process",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 212.49,
          "end": 214.41,
          "en": "to finish here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 214.41,
          "end": 215.46,
          "en": "And once it's finished,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 215.46,
          "end": 218.163,
          "en": "we can execute this Firebase log in command.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 219.06,
          "end": 221.97,
          "en": "Now this might prompt you for your username and password",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 221.97,
          "end": 224.433,
          "en": "and ultimately it should log you in successfully.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 225.81,
          "end": 228.99,
          "en": "Now, once you logged in, you can run Firebase init",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 228.99,
          "end": 230.67000000000002,
          "en": "to turn your local project",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 230.67000000000002,
          "end": 233.973,
          "en": "into a project connected to a Firebase project, so to say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 235.77,
          "end": 237.12,
          "en": "Now here, when you run this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 237.12,
          "end": 240,
          "en": "you're asked a couple of questions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 240,
          "end": 242.913,
          "en": "For example, which Firebase features you want to use.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 243.75,
          "end": 246.48,
          "en": "And here we got a broad variety of features we could use.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 246.48,
          "end": 249.12,
          "en": "I'm only interested in hosting here though",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 249.12,
          "end": 252.36,
          "en": "and specifically the option where I configure my files",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 252.36,
          "end": 255.933,
          "en": "for a Firebase Hosting, not the GitHub actions option.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 256.77,
          "end": 259.08,
          "en": "If I had space, this is selected",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 259.08,
          "end": 261.21,
          "en": "and we don't need any other features here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 261.21,
          "end": 262.563,
          "en": "It's just that feature.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 263.64,
          "end": 265.89,
          "en": "So we can hit enter thereafter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 265.89,
          "end": 269.04,
          "en": "And as a next step, we wanna choose use an existing project",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 269.04,
          "end": 272.55,
          "en": "because we already created a project on Firebase.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 272.55,
          "end": 273.96,
          "en": "So I hit enter here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 273.96,
          "end": 277.14,
          "en": "and then select that project, which I just created.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 277.14,
          "end": 278.31,
          "en": "If it's not showing up here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 278.31,
          "end": 280.533,
          "en": "you can of course also create a new project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 281.67,
          "end": 285.3,
          "en": "Now, as a next step, it's asking me where my files are,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 285.3,
          "end": 287.04,
          "en": "basically, that should be uploaded",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 287.04,
          "end": 288.9,
          "en": "and in my case, that's the build folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 288.9,
          "end": 292.323,
          "en": "So I will type build here, not public, but build.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 293.82,
          "end": 295.83,
          "en": "It then asks me if this should be configured",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 295.83,
          "end": 299.1,
          "en": "as a single page app and we will choose Y for a yes here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 299.1,
          "end": 301.89,
          "en": "And I'll get back to this question later in this section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 301.89,
          "end": 304.593,
          "en": "For the moment, let's just pick Y here and hit enter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 305.76,
          "end": 308.34,
          "en": "And we don't need automatic build or deploy.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 308.34,
          "end": 309.903,
          "en": "So I will hit No here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 310.74,
          "end": 312.6,
          "en": "It then asks me if it should override",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 312.6,
          "end": 314.94,
          "en": "the existing build.index.html file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 314.94,
          "end": 316.08,
          "en": "and we don't wanna do that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 316.08,
          "end": 317.703,
          "en": "so we choose No here as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 319.44,
          "end": 322.83,
          "en": "So that now initialized this project as a Firebase project",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 322.83,
          "end": 325.14,
          "en": "and connected it to the backend.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 325.14,
          "end": 328.5,
          "en": "It gave us two new files, which basically establish",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 328.5,
          "end": 329.82,
          "en": "that connection to the backend",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 329.82,
          "end": 332.733,
          "en": "and contain some extra settings for hosting this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 334.40999999999997,
          "end": 336.87,
          "en": "With that out of the way, the next step is to run",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 336.87,
          "end": 341.31,
          "en": "this command to upload our files to Firebase.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 341.31,
          "end": 343.29,
          "en": "So that's what I'll do here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 343.29,
          "end": 346.56,
          "en": "I'll run Firebase deploy, and this will now upload the files",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 346.56,
          "end": 349.053,
          "en": "from my build folder to Firebase.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 349.89,
          "end": 353.34000000000003,
          "en": "So let's wait for that to finish here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 353.34000000000003,
          "end": 354.3,
          "en": "Here we go.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 354.3,
          "end": 356.61,
          "en": "And it also gives us a URL",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 356.61,
          "end": 358.473,
          "en": "where we can visit our website.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 359.43,
          "end": 363.33,
          "en": "So if I now enter this in the browser, here we go.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 363.33,
          "end": 367.563,
          "en": "That's my website now hosted on Firebase servers.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 368.67,
          "end": 370.71,
          "en": "And it's working just as it worked locally",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 370.71,
          "end": 374.55,
          "en": "but now it's out there in the web for everyone to visit.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 374.55,
          "end": 377.28,
          "en": "Now, once it was deployed here in the Firebase console,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 377.28,
          "end": 378.993,
          "en": "you could add a custom domain.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
